        "text": "Opening of Chapter 3 ('Identify health system challenges and needs', page 29), outlining the chapter's purpose, tools (Annex 3.1 process matrix, Fig. 3.2.1 root causes of common bottlenecks, Annex 3.2 bottleneck-mapping worksheet), objectives, inputs (named team and stakeholders, shared programme vision, personas), and expected outputs (Output 3.4 current-state workflow diagrams, Output 3.2 prioritized bottlenecks, and Output 3.3 mapped health system challenges).",
