      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Highlights two Principles for Digital Development (page 30) for Chapter 3—'Understand the Existing Ecosystem' (engaging target end-users, consulting research on networks, cultures, politics, data needs, infrastructure, and markets, and coordinating across government and civil society) and 'Design with the User' (incorporating end-users and stakeholders across the project life cycle, improving current workflows incrementally, prioritizing underserved groups, and allowing opt-out).",
