        "text": "Presents Box 3.4.2 ('Linking health system challenges to universal health coverage', page 40), explaining how to map bottlenecks across the six layers of the updated Tanahashi framework for Universal Health Coverage (UHC)—Accountability coverage, Accessibility and availability of services, Contact coverage, Continuous coverage, Effective coverage, and Financial coverage—with reference to the Annex 3.2 template.",
