      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents Figure 4.1.1 (page 47), the full WHO Classification of Digital Health Interventions (2018) taxonomy organized across four user groups: 1.0 Clients (1.1–1.7), 2.0 Healthcare Providers (2.1–2.10), 3.0 Health System Managers (3.1–3.7), and 4.0 Data Services (4.1–4.4).",
