      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Page 64",
      "pageStart": 64,
      "pageEnd": 64,
      "target": "../sections/page-064.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "52\nDigital implementation investment guide\nFig. 4.2.1.\t\nRoles and contributions of component “building blocks” to the enabling environment for \ndigital health enterprises.\nSource: WHO/ITU National eHealth strategy toolkit, 2012 (3).\n\t+ Direct and coordinate eHealth at the national level; ensure \nalignment with health goals and political support; promote \nawareness and engage stakeholders.\n\t+ Use mechanisms, expertise, coordination and partnerships to \ndevelop or adopt eHealth components (e.g. standards). \n\t+ Support and empower required change, implementation \nof recommendations and monitoring",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents Figure 4.2.1 (page 52), adapted from the 2012 WHO/ITU National eHealth Strategy Toolkit, detailing the roles and contributions of the seven component building blocks across the Enabling Environment (Leadership and Governance; Strategy and Investment; Legislation, Policy and Compliance; Workforce; Standards and Interoperability) and the ICT Environment (Infrastructure; Services and Applications).",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
