        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Highlights the 'Build for Sustainability' Principle for Digital Development (page 64) for Chapter 5, outlining core tenets including planning for sustainability from the outset, defining a sustainable business model, investing in local ICT service providers, integrating with local government and national strategies, collaborating across partners, and designing adaptable programmes.",
