        "text": "Presents Figure 5.1 ('Essential components of a digital health implementation', page 66)—illustrating how Health Content, Digital Health Interventions, and Digital Applications rest on the seven building blocks of the foundational ICT and Enabling Environment layer—and begins Table 5.2 ('Illustrative implementation considerations for digital health') covering Strategy and Investment, Infrastructure, and Legislation, Policy and Compliance.",
