        "text": "Concludes Table 5.2 (page 67), listing key implementation planning questions across Leadership and Governance, Workforce, Services and Applications, Standards and Interoperability, and Health Content, adapted from the WHO/ITU National eHealth Strategy Toolkit and the MAPS Toolkit.",
