      "target": "../sections/page-080.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "68\nDigital implementation investment guide\nBox 5.3. \t\nDescription of digital health interventions reviewed in the WHO guideline.\nAnnex 5.3 expands on additional implementation considerations for specific digital health interventions prioritized in \nthe WHO guideline (1). If you are considering one of these interventions, review Annex 5.3 for a more nuanced list of \nfactors that could affect your implementation.\nDigital health \nintervention\nDefinition\nSynonyms and \nother descriptors\nBirth notification\nDigital approaches to support the notification of births, \nto trigger the subsequent steps of",
