        "text": "Section 5.2 ('Legislation, policy and compliance considerations', page 70) and Section 5.2.1 ('Data management, privacy and security') outline policy and regulatory requirements for digital health implementations, providing a nine-point checklist covering patient/provider privacy, transmission security, server access controls, donor and research data use, data flows, cloud hosting, data ownership, redundant backups, and HIS policy adherence.",
