        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents a case study on mHero (using data standards to effectively integrate different digital health interventions), describing how IntraHealth’s iHRIS health workforce registry, UNICEF’s RapidPro messaging platform, and Jembi’s OpenHIM interoperability layer were integrated using open standards (HL7 FHIR and the OpenHIE framework) to enable two-way mobile communication between ministries of health and health workers, illustrated by Figure 5.6.2.",
