      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces Chapter 6 (Link the digital health implementation to the enterprise architecture), outlining how to transition from siloed digital health implementations to an exchanged digital health system architecture and listing the chapter’s tools (OpenHIE diagram in Fig. 6.3.2, TOGAF architecture building blocks in Annex 6.1, illustrative list of common components), objectives, inputs, and outputs (Outputs 4.3 and 6.1–6.5).",
