      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces Chapter 8 (Monitor the implementation and use data effectively), highlighting monitoring and evaluation (M&E), data use, and adaptive management, and listing the chapter’s tools (WHO M&E practical guide, Adaptive management checklist in Annex 8.1, RE-AIM framework, Logic model template in Annex 8.2), objectives, inputs, and outputs (Logic model in Output 8.1; M&E and adaptive management plan in Outputs 8.2 and 8.3).",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
