      "content": "144\nDigital implementation investment guide\nOPPORTUNITIES \nFOR INTEROPERABILITY AND LINKAGES TO OTHER \nDIGITAL HEALTH \nINTERVENTIONS\nIntegrate with provider-to-provider telemedicine in cases where referral to another health worker is \nrequired.\nLink with targeted client communication to follow up on clients/patients following the consultation.\nRISKS AND \nMITIGATION \nSTRATEGIES\nThere may be risks with unaccredited or unlicensed health workers using a client-to-provider \ntelemedicine system. Establish a clear legal framework for implementing telemedicine, including \nlicensing and regulation of h",
