      "content": "154\nDigital implementation investment guide\nRISKS AND \nMITIGATION \nSTRATEGIES\nHealth workers may face the added work burden of operating a dual system when using both a \nmanual/paper-based system and the digital tool. Establish a plan or processes to replace manual/\npaper-based systems or account for the dual burden of managing these two systems.\nConsider local policies on digital identities when designing a programme to ensure that the \nprogramme does no harm. Digital tracking of individuals’ health status may be controversial in some \ncircumstances, such as among refugees or other groups who",
